# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill in. Vite loads it in dev, build and preview.
#
# VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN: a public Mapbox access token (pk.…) for the map demo; leave empty to see the
# missing-token message. It is inlined into this remote's bundle: use a URL-restricted public token.
# This remote's own value is used, also when the shell hosts it.
VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=
